<title>USA: Hawaii $55 mln road deal yields 5.70 pct in 2016.</title>
<headline>Hawaii $55 mln road deal yields 5.70 pct in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
